{
  "meta": {
    "title": "凌晨三点的休息室",
    "estimatedPlayTime": "35-50分钟",
    "theme": "在无人知晓的深夜，两个迷茫的人互相陪伴着长大。"
  },
  "start": {
    "id": "start",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……你也还没睡吗？",
    "next": "d1"
  },
  "d1": {
    "id": "d1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "外面一直在下雨。",
    "next": "d2"
  },
  "d2": {
    "id": "d2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "不知道为什么，每次下雨的时候，我都会突然变得特别清醒。",
    "next": "d3"
  },
  "d3": {
    "id": "d3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "明明白天还能假装自己过得不错。",
    "next": "d4"
  },
  "d4": {
    "id": "d4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可一到凌晨，情绪就像坏掉的水龙头一样关不住。",
    "next": "d5"
  },
  "d5": {
    "id": "d5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "啊，对了……我叫岚。",
    "next": "d6"
  },
  "d6": {
    "id": "d6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "是个很普通的大学生。",
    "next": "d7"
  },
  "d7": {
    "id": "d7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "普通到，丢进人群里就再也找不到的那种。",
    "next": "d8"
  },
  "d8": {
    "id": "d8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "最近学校一直在催毕业规划。",
    "next": "d9"
  },
  "d9": {
    "id": "d9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "周围的人好像都已经知道自己以后要做什么了。",
    "next": "d10"
  },
  "d10": {
    "id": "d10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有人考研，有人创业，有人已经拿到了实习offer。",
    "next": "d11"
  },
  "d11": {
    "id": "d11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "只有我……还像站在雾里。",
    "next": "choice_1"
  },
  "choice_1": {
    "id": "choice_1",
    "type": "choice",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "你最近，最常为什么事情焦虑？",
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "对未来很迷茫",
        "next": "future_1"
      },
      {
        "text": "压力太大了",
        "next": "stress_1"
      },
      {
        "text": "感觉很孤独",
        "next": "lonely_1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "future_1": {
    "id": "future_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "未来啊……其实我最害怕的也是这个。",
    "next": "future_2"
  },
  "future_2": {
    "id": "future_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "前几天老师让我们做未来五年的职业规划。",
    "next": "future_3"
  },
  "future_3": {
    "id": "future_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我坐在电脑前整整两个小时，一个字都没写出来。",
    "next": "future_4"
  },
  "future_4": {
    "id": "future_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "因为我根本不知道自己五年后会变成什么样。",
    "next": "future_5"
  },
  "future_5": {
    "id": "future_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "小时候总觉得，长大以后就会自然找到方向。",
    "next": "future_6"
  },
  "future_6": {
    "id": "future_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可现在真的长大一点了，反而更迷路了。",
    "next": "future_7"
  },
  "future_7": {
    "id": "future_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有时候刷朋友圈，看见别人过得很好，我会突然特别焦虑。",
    "next": "future_8"
  },
  "future_8": {
    "id": "future_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "明明大家都差不多年纪。",
    "next": "future_9"
  },
  "future_9": {
    "id": "future_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "为什么别人好像已经开始发光了。",
    "next": "future_10"
  },
  "future_10": {
    "id": "future_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "而我还在原地打转。",
    "next": "future_11"
  },
  "future_11": {
    "id": "future_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "前段时间我投了很多实习简历。",
    "next": "future_12"
  },
  "future_12": {
    "id": "future_12",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "每次邮箱弹出新消息，我都会紧张一下。",
    "next": "future_13"
  },
  "future_13": {
    "id": "future_13",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "结果打开之后，大部分都是自动回复。",
    "next": "future_14"
  },
  "future_14": {
    "id": "future_14",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有一次甚至连拒绝邮件都没有。",
    "next": "future_15"
  },
  "future_15": {
    "id": "future_15",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我盯着空荡荡的收件箱看了很久。",
    "next": "future_16"
  },
  "future_16": {
    "id": "future_16",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "突然特别想哭。",
    "next": "future_17"
  },
  "future_17": {
    "id": "future_17",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "不是因为失败。",
    "next": "future_18"
  },
  "future_18": {
    "id": "future_18",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "而是因为那一瞬间，我突然觉得自己好像很没用。",
    "next": "future_19"
  },
  "future_19": {
    "id": "future_19",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……抱歉。",
    "next": "future_20"
  },
  "future_20": {
    "id": "future_20",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "是不是突然说了很多奇怪的话。",
    "next": "future_choice"
  },
  "future_choice": {
    "id": "future_choice",
    "type": "choice",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "如果是你的话……会怎么面对这种迷茫？",
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "慢一点也没关系",
        "next": "future_good_1"
      },
      {
        "text": "其实大家都很害怕",
        "next": "future_real_1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "future_good_1": {
    "id": "future_good_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……慢一点，也没关系吗？",
    "next": "future_good_2"
  },
  "future_good_2": {
    "id": "future_good_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "以前好像从来没人和我说过这种话。",
    "next": "future_good_3"
  },
  "future_good_3": {
    "id": "future_good_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "大家都在催我往前跑。",
    "next": "future_good_4"
  },
  "future_good_4": {
    "id": "future_good_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "老师、父母、甚至我自己。",
    "next": "future_good_5"
  },
  "future_good_5": {
    "id": "future_good_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可我其实只是有点累了。",
    "next": "future_good_6"
  },
  "future_good_6": {
    "id": "future_good_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有时候我会偷偷想。",
    "next": "future_good_7"
  },
  "future_good_7": {
    "id": "future_good_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "如果人生不是比赛就好了。",
    "next": "future_good_8"
  },
  "future_good_8": {
    "id": "future_good_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "这样的话，是不是就不用一直和别人比较。",
    "next": "future_good_9"
  },
  "future_good_9": {
    "id": "future_good_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "你知道吗。",
    "next": "future_good_10"
  },
  "future_good_10": {
    "id": "future_good_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "今天下午我一个人去了学校后面的便利店。",
    "next": "future_good_11"
  },
  "future_good_11": {
    "id": "future_good_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "结账的时候，店员姐姐问我是不是很累。",
    "next": "future_good_12"
  },
  "future_good_12": {
    "id": "future_good_12",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我当时愣了一下。",
    "next": "future_good_13"
  },
  "future_good_13": {
    "id": "future_good_13",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "因为已经很久没人问过我累不累了。",
    "next": "future_good_14"
  },
  "future_good_14": {
    "id": "future_good_14",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "后来我提着关东煮回宿舍的时候。",
    "next": "future_good_15"
  },
  "future_good_15": {
    "id": "future_good_15",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "突然觉得，原来人真的会因为一句很普通的话被救一下。",
    "next": "future_good_16"
  },
  "future_good_16": {
    "id": "future_good_16",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "现在也是。",
    "next": "future_good_17"
  },
  "future_good_17": {
    "id": "future_good_17",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "听见你说‘慢一点也没关系’的时候。",
    "next": "future_end_1"
  },
  "future_end_1": {
    "id": "future_end_1",
    "type": "ending",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我突然觉得，长大也许不是突然变得厉害，而是即使害怕，也愿意慢慢往前走。谢谢你今晚陪我聊天。",
    "endingTitle": "结局A：慢慢长大的勇气"
  },
  "future_real_1": {
    "id": "future_real_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……是这样吗？",
    "next": "future_real_2"
  },
  "future_real_2": {
    "id": "future_real_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "原来大家都会害怕未来。",
    "next": "future_real_3"
  },
  "future_real_3": {
    "id": "future_real_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我以前总以为，只有我是废物。",
    "next": "future_real_4"
  },
  "future_real_4": {
    "id": "future_real_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "因为别人看起来都很厉害。",
    "next": "future_real_5"
  },
  "future_real_5": {
    "id": "future_real_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "后来有一次。",
    "next": "future_real_6"
  },
  "future_real_6": {
    "id": "future_real_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我和室友半夜聊天。",
    "next": "future_real_7"
  },
  "future_real_7": {
    "id": "future_real_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "她突然问我。",
    "next": "future_real_8"
  },
  "future_real_8": {
    "id": "future_real_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "‘你说我们以后真的会变成想成为的大人吗？’",
    "next": "future_real_9"
  },
  "future_real_9": {
    "id": "future_real_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "那一刻我才发现。",
    "next": "future_real_10"
  },
  "future_real_10": {
    "id": "future_real_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "原来每个人都在偷偷害怕。",
    "next": "future_real_11"
  },
  "future_real_11": {
    "id": "future_real_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "只是大家白天都装得很镇定。",
    "next": "future_real_12"
  },
  "future_real_12": {
    "id": "future_real_12",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "其实有时候能撑到今天。",
    "next": "future_real_13"
  },
  "future_real_13": {
    "id": "future_real_13",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "就已经很厉害了吧。",
    "next": "future_real_14"
  },
  "future_real_14": {
    "id": "future_real_14",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "谢谢你愿意和我说这些。",
    "next": "future_end_2"
  },
  "future_end_2": {
    "id": "future_end_2",
    "type": "ending",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "原来不是只有我一个人站在黑夜里。谢谢你让我知道，迷茫并不是一件可耻的事情。",
    "endingTitle": "结局B：原来大家都一样"
  },
  "stress_1": {
    "id": "stress_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "压力吗……最近我也快喘不过气了。",
    "next": "stress_2"
  },
  "stress_2": {
    "id": "stress_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "前几天为了做答辩，我连续熬了三个通宵。",
    "next": "stress_3"
  },
  "stress_3": {
    "id": "stress_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "咖啡喝到胃疼，还是不敢停下来。",
    "next": "stress_4"
  },
  "stress_4": {
    "id": "stress_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "因为总觉得，只要稍微休息一下，就会被别人超过。",
    "next": "stress_5"
  },
  "stress_5": {
    "id": "stress_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "白天我会假装自己没事。",
    "next": "stress_6"
  },
  "stress_6": {
    "id": "stress_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "和同学聊天、吃饭、开玩笑。",
    "next": "stress_7"
  },
  "stress_7": {
    "id": "stress_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可一到晚上。",
    "next": "stress_8"
  },
  "stress_8": {
    "id": "stress_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我就会突然很想哭。",
    "next": "stress_9"
  },
  "stress_9": {
    "id": "stress_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有一次凌晨两点。",
    "next": "stress_10"
  },
  "stress_10": {
    "id": "stress_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我一个人在阳台吹风。",
    "next": "stress_11"
  },
  "stress_11": {
    "id": "stress_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "那时候我突然在想。",
    "next": "stress_12"
  },
  "stress_12": {
    "id": "stress_12",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "如果我消失几天，会有人发现吗？",
    "next": "stress_13"
  },
  "stress_13": {
    "id": "stress_13",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……抱歉。",
    "next": "stress_14"
  },
  "stress_14": {
    "id": "stress_14",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "是不是有点太负能量了。",
    "next": "stress_choice"
  },
  "stress_choice": {
    "id": "stress_choice",
    "type": "choice",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "你会怎么面对这种压力？",
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "你已经很努力了",
        "next": "stress_good_1"
      },
      {
        "text": "累的时候就休息吧",
        "next": "stress_soft_1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "stress_good_1": {
    "id": "stress_good_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……真的会有人这么想吗？",
    "next": "stress_good_2"
  },
  "stress_good_2": {
    "id": "stress_good_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我总觉得自己做得不够好。",
    "next": "stress_good_3"
  },
  "stress_good_3": {
    "id": "stress_good_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "别人拿奖学金的时候。",
    "next": "stress_good_4"
  },
  "stress_good_4": {
    "id": "stress_good_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我在担心会不会挂科。",
    "next": "stress_good_5"
  },
  "stress_good_5": {
    "id": "stress_good_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "别人已经开始规划未来的时候。",
    "next": "stress_good_6"
  },
  "stress_good_6": {
    "id": "stress_good_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我连明天都不知道怎么办。",
    "next": "stress_good_7"
  },
  "stress_good_7": {
    "id": "stress_good_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有时候我会很讨厌自己。",
    "next": "stress_good_8"
  },
  "stress_good_8": {
    "id": "stress_good_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "觉得自己为什么不能再优秀一点。",
    "next": "stress_good_9"
  },
  "stress_good_9": {
    "id": "stress_good_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可是现在听你这么说。",
    "next": "stress_good_10"
  },
  "stress_good_10": {
    "id": "stress_good_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "突然觉得，好像终于有人愿意理解我了。",
    "next": "stress_good_11"
  },
  "stress_good_11": {
    "id": "stress_good_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "原来被人接住，是这种感觉。",
    "next": "stress_end_1"
  },
  "stress_end_1": {
    "id": "stress_end_1",
    "type": "ending",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有时候能撑到今天，就已经很厉害了。谢谢你今晚接住了快要掉下去的我。",
    "endingTitle": "结局C：被理解的夜晚"
  },
  "stress_soft_1": {
    "id": "stress_soft_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "休息吗……",
    "next": "stress_soft_2"
  },
  "stress_soft_2": {
    "id": "stress_soft_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我已经很久没有真正休息过了。",
    "next": "stress_soft_3"
  },
  "stress_soft_3": {
    "id": "stress_soft_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "每次躺下的时候。",
    "next": "stress_soft_4"
  },
  "stress_soft_4": {
    "id": "stress_soft_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "脑子里都会自动开始想待办事项。",
    "next": "stress_soft_5"
  },
  "stress_soft_5": {
    "id": "stress_soft_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "作业、答辩、实习、未来。",
    "next": "stress_soft_6"
  },
  "stress_soft_6": {
    "id": "stress_soft_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "感觉人生像一条不会停止的传送带。",
    "next": "stress_soft_7"
  },
  "stress_soft_7": {
    "id": "stress_soft_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可是现在窗外下着雨。",
    "next": "stress_soft_8"
  },
  "stress_soft_8": {
    "id": "stress_soft_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "这里又很安静。",
    "next": "stress_soft_9"
  },
  "stress_soft_9": {
    "id": "stress_soft_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "突然觉得，如果稍微停一下。",
    "next": "stress_soft_10"
  },
  "stress_soft_10": {
    "id": "stress_soft_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "好像也不会世界末日。",
    "next": "stress_soft_11"
  },
  "stress_soft_11": {
    "id": "stress_soft_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "等天亮以后，再继续努力吧。",
    "next": "stress_end_2"
  },
  "stress_end_2": {
    "id": "stress_end_2",
    "type": "ending",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "谢谢你今晚陪我一起休息。原来人不是机器，也可以允许自己偶尔脆弱一下。",
    "endingTitle": "结局D：短暂休息的资格"
  },
  "lonely_1": {
    "id": "lonely_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "孤独吗……",
    "next": "lonely_2"
  },
  "lonely_2": {
    "id": "lonely_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "其实我以前一直觉得，大学应该是很热闹的。",
    "next": "lonely_3"
  },
  "lonely_3": {
    "id": "lonely_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "会有很多朋友。",
    "next": "lonely_4"
  },
  "lonely_4": {
    "id": "lonely_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "每天都过得像青春电影一样。",
    "next": "lonely_5"
  },
  "lonely_5": {
    "id": "lonely_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可后来才发现。",
    "next": "lonely_6"
  },
  "lonely_6": {
    "id": "lonely_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "人就算坐在人群里，也还是会孤独。",
    "next": "lonely_7"
  },
  "lonely_7": {
    "id": "lonely_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有时候我打开微信。",
    "next": "lonely_8"
  },
  "lonely_8": {
    "id": "lonely_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "打了一长段话。",
    "next": "lonely_9"
  },
  "lonely_9": {
    "id": "lonely_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "最后又默默删掉。",
    "next": "lonely_10"
  },
  "lonely_10": {
    "id": "lonely_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "因为害怕打扰别人。",
    "next": "lonely_11"
  },
  "lonely_11": {
    "id": "lonely_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "也害怕没人回复。",
    "next": "lonely_12"
  },
  "lonely_12": {
    "id": "lonely_12",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "最难受的时候。",
    "next": "lonely_13"
  },
  "lonely_13": {
    "id": "lonely_13",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我会故意戴着耳机在校园里乱走。",
    "next": "lonely_14"
  },
  "lonely_14": {
    "id": "lonely_14",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "假装有人陪着自己。",
    "next": "lonely_choice"
  },
  "lonely_choice": {
    "id": "lonely_choice",
    "type": "choice",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "如果是你的话，会怎么面对这种孤独？",
    "choices": [
      {
        "text": "至少现在还有我陪你",
        "next": "lonely_good_1"
      },
      {
        "text": "孤独不代表没人爱你",
        "next": "lonely_soft_1"
      }
    ]
  },
  "lonely_good_1": {
    "id": "lonely_good_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "……你这样说的话，我会有点想哭。",
    "next": "lonely_good_2"
  },
  "lonely_good_2": {
    "id": "lonely_good_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "原来真的会有人。",
    "next": "lonely_good_3"
  },
  "lonely_good_3": {
    "id": "lonely_good_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "愿意在深夜陪一个陌生人聊天。",
    "next": "lonely_good_4"
  },
  "lonely_good_4": {
    "id": "lonely_good_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "你知道吗。",
    "next": "lonely_good_5"
  },
  "lonely_good_5": {
    "id": "lonely_good_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "小时候我很怕黑。",
    "next": "lonely_good_6"
  },
  "lonely_good_6": {
    "id": "lonely_good_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "每次停电的时候。",
    "next": "lonely_good_7"
  },
  "lonely_good_7": {
    "id": "lonely_good_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我都会躲到妈妈旁边。",
    "next": "lonely_good_8"
  },
  "lonely_good_8": {
    "id": "lonely_good_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "后来长大以后。",
    "next": "lonely_good_9"
  },
  "lonely_good_9": {
    "id": "lonely_good_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "身边的人越来越多。",
    "next": "lonely_good_10"
  },
  "lonely_good_10": {
    "id": "lonely_good_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "可我反而更容易害怕黑夜了。",
    "next": "lonely_good_11"
  },
  "lonely_good_11": {
    "id": "lonely_good_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "因为很多情绪已经不知道该和谁说。",
    "next": "lonely_good_12"
  },
  "lonely_good_12": {
    "id": "lonely_good_12",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "但现在。",
    "next": "lonely_good_13"
  },
  "lonely_good_13": {
    "id": "lonely_good_13",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我突然觉得这个世界好像也没那么糟糕。",
    "next": "lonely_end_1"
  },
  "lonely_end_1": {
    "id": "lonely_end_1",
    "type": "ending",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "原来陪别人走出黑夜的时候，自己也会慢慢看见光。以后如果你也难过，希望也会有人这样陪着你。",
    "endingTitle": "结局E：黑夜里的陪伴"
  },
  "lonely_soft_1": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_1",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "孤独……不代表没人爱吗？",
    "next": "lonely_soft_2"
  },
  "lonely_soft_2": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_2",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "我以前总觉得。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_3"
  },
  "lonely_soft_3": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_3",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "没人主动找我，就是我不够重要。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_4"
  },
  "lonely_soft_4": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_4",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "后来我发现。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_5"
  },
  "lonely_soft_5": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_5",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "大家其实都在自己的生活里努力挣扎。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_6"
  },
  "lonely_soft_6": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_6",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有的人忙着兼职。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_7"
  },
  "lonely_soft_7": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_7",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有的人忙着考研。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_8"
  },
  "lonely_soft_8": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_8",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "有的人甚至连情绪崩溃的时间都没有。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_9"
  },
  "lonely_soft_9": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_9",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "也许不是没人爱我们。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_10"
  },
  "lonely_soft_10": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_10",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "只是长大以后，大家表达爱的方式变笨了。",
    "next": "lonely_soft_11"
  },
  "lonely_soft_11": {
    "id": "lonely_soft_11",
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "谢谢你今晚让我明白这一点。",
    "next": "lonely_end_2"
  },
  "lonely_end_2": {
    "id": "lonely_end_2",
    "type": "ending",
    "name": "岚",
    "text": "也许孤独不会立刻消失，但至少现在，我已经没那么害怕它了。",
    "endingTitle": "结局F：学会与孤独相处"
  }
}